Chapter: E1000AsdeNoLink
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Kernel chapter E1000e
  cites Kernel chapter Pci
  cites Dev chapter NicAsde

 The regression guard for a board trip that came home with a blank row.

 blu's ASDE stage flew on the ASUS on 2026-08-04 and painted NOTHING. The
 cause was not a fault: with no link the stage went through
 e1000-phy-bring-up, whose e1000-await-aneg spends a million iterations and
 makes a full MDIC transaction on each, and a real MDIO transaction is tens
 of microseconds. Two arms of that is a minute or worse. Bounded, and
 indistinguishable from a hang to anyone watching a screen.

 A bench cable is normally out, so NO LINK IS THE NORMAL BENCH CONDITION
 and the arm below is the one that matters. -e1000-no-link is what makes
 the bed produce it, which was worth finding out: the failure had been
 called unreproducible here.

 What this asserts is that the stage COMPLETES on a dead link and says so.
 It cannot assert how long that takes -- a test that passes or fails on
 elapsed time on a shared box is a flaky test -- so the bound lives in the
 constants and this guards the observable half: every arm comes back, and
 comes back carrying a state that renders.

Section: Judges

  yn : Boolean -> Text
  yn (b) = if b then "yes" else "no"

  arms-give-nolink : PciDevice -> Boolean
  arms-give-nolink (dev) =
   let mmio = na-mmio-of dev
   in let on = na-bring-up mmio True
   in let off = na-bring-up mmio False
   in if (on.na-gave) /= na-gave-nolink then False
   else (off.na-gave) == na-gave-nolink

 The PHY is still reachable with the link down, so a nolink verdict must
 not be confused with an unreachable PHY. If this ever answers no, the
 give-up state is reporting the wrong thing.

  phy-still-reached : PciDevice -> Boolean
  phy-still-reached (dev) =
   let mmio = na-mmio-of dev
   in (na-bring-up mmio True).na-phy == 1

  row-still-paints : PciDevice -> Boolean
  row-still-paints (dev) =
   let mmio = na-mmio-of dev
   in text-length (na-line "ASDE=1" (na-bring-up mmio True)) > 20

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let scan = pci-scan-bus 0
    in act
      when e1000-find scan
        is Just (dev) -> act
          print-line-uni ("arms say nolink : " & yn (arms-give-nolink dev))
          print-line-uni ("phy reached     : " & yn (phy-still-reached dev))
          print-line-uni ("row paints      : " & yn (row-still-paints dev))
        end
        is None -> print-line-uni ("candidate found : no")
    end
  end

